# Debugging mode

Follow `@.cursor/rules/core/workflow.mdc` (Debugging section).

**Full prompt template:** `@.cursor/prompts/debugging.md`

1. Map symptom to flow in `@.cursor/context/system-flows.md`.
2. Grep only files from `@.cursor/context/module-map.md`.
3. Root cause → minimal fix → describe manual verification for user.
4. **Where to edit next time** — `path/file` → function (`@.cursor/rules/core/developer-ergonomics.mdc`).

No refactors. No unrelated files.
